msgstr "No se ha podido desactivar la pantalla de bloqueo"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2617
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that the lock screen be disabled during the upgrade "
"to prevent later issues. Please ensure your screen lock is disabled before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Recomendamos encarecidamente que se desactive la pantalla de bloqueo durante "
"la actualización para evitar problemas a posteriori. Cerciórese de "
"desactivarla antes de proseguir."

